    "unit": "# Generated by Just Dashboard from spec.json. Edits here are overwritten;\n# change the network on the dashboard's Network pages instead.\n[Unit]\nDescription=Just Dashboard network: the devices, routes, gateway and shaping it made\nDocumentation=https://github.com/JustDashboard/Just-Dashboard\nWants=network-online.target\nAfter=network-online.target systemd-networkd.service NetworkManager.service networking.service docker.service ufw.service firewalld.service\n# systemd-networkd removes routes and rules it did not make when it restarts\n# (netplan apply, an upgrade), so this unit restarts with it and puts them back.\nPartOf=systemd-networkd.service\n\n[Service]\nType=oneshot\n\t\tRemainAfterExit=yes\nExecStartPre=/etc/just-dashboard/network/network-recovery --network-recover-boot /etc/just-dashboard/network pending\nExecStartPre=-iptables -D FORWARD -m connmark --mark 0x4a000000/0xff000000 -m comment --comment just-dashboard-gateway -j ACCEPT\nExecStartPre=-iptables -D INPUT -m connmark --mark 0x4a000000/0xff000000 -m comment --comment just-dashboard-gateway -j ACCEPT\nExecStartPre=-iptables -D DOCKER-USER -m connmark --mark 0x4a000000/0xff000000 -m comment --comment just-dashboard-gateway -j ACCEPT\nExecStartPre=-ip6tables -D FORWARD -m connmark --mark 0x4a000000/0xff000000 -m comment --comment just-dashboard-gateway -j ACCEPT\nExecStartPre=-ip6tables -D INPUT -m connmark --mark 0x4a000000/0xff000000 -m comment --comment just-dashboard-gateway -j ACCEPT\nExecStartPre=-ip6tables -D DOCKER-USER -m connmark --mark 0x4a000000/0xff000000 -m comment --comment just-dashboard-gateway -j ACCEPT\nExecStartPre=-tc qdisc del dev jdvmdum1 root\nExecStartPre=-tc filter del dev jdvmdum1 parent ffff: prio 1\nExecStartPre=-tc qdisc del dev jdvmbr0 root\nExecStart=-ip -force -batch /etc/just-dashboard/network/links.batch\nExecStart=-ip -6 -force -batch /etc/just-dashboard/network/rules6.batch\nExecStart=-tc -force -batch /etc/just-dashboard/network/shaping.batch\nExecStart=-nft -f /etc/just-dashboard/network/gateway.nft\nExecStart=-iptables -I FORWARD 1 -m connmark --mark 0x4a000000/0xff000000 -m comment --comment just-dashboard-gateway -j ACCEPT\nExecStart=-iptables -I INPUT 1 -m connmark --mark 0x4a000000/0xff000000 -m comment --comment just-dashboard-gateway -j ACCEPT\nExecStart=-iptables -I DOCKER-USER 1 -m connmark --mark 0x4a000000/0xff000000 -m comment --comment just-dashboard-gateway -j ACCEPT\nExecStart=-ip6tables -I FORWARD 1 -m connmark --mark 0x4a000000/0xff000000 -m comment --comment just-dashboard-gateway -j ACCEPT\nExecStart=-ip6tables -I INPUT 1 -m connmark --mark 0x4a000000/0xff000000 -m comment --comment just-dashboard-gateway -j ACCEPT\nExecStart=-ip6tables -I DOCKER-USER 1 -m connmark --mark 0x4a000000/0xff000000 -m comment --comment just-dashboard-gateway -j ACCEPT\nExecStart=-sysctl -q -p /etc/sysctl.d/90-just-dashboard.conf\nExecStop=-nft delete table inet jd_gateway\nExecStop=-iptables -D FORWARD -m connmark --mark 0x4a000000/0xff000000 -m comment --comment just-dashboard-gateway -j ACCEPT\nExecStop=-iptables -D INPUT -m connmark --mark 0x4a000000/0xff000000 -m comment --comment just-dashboard-gateway -j ACCEPT\nExecStop=-iptables -D DOCKER-USER -m connmark --mark 0x4a000000/0xff000000 -m comment --comment just-dashboard-gateway -j ACCEPT\nExecStop=-ip6tables -D FORWARD -m connmark --mark 0x4a000000/0xff000000 -m comment --comment just-dashboard-gateway -j ACCEPT\nExecStop=-ip6tables -D INPUT -m connmark --mark 0x4a000000/0xff000000 -m comment --comment just-dashboard-gateway -j ACCEPT\nExecStop=-ip6tables -D DOCKER-USER -m connmark --mark 0x4a000000/0xff000000 -m comment --comment just-dashboard-gateway -j ACCEPT\n\n[Install]\nWantedBy=multi-user.target systemd-networkd.service\n"
